OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FGenerally
OL,6,Fcloudy with the odd bright or clear
OL,7,Fspell through the evening and
OL,8,Fovernight. Showers becoming more
OL,9,Fisolated and light for a time through
OL,10,Fthe evening and overnight. Feeling
OL,11,Fcool.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FA cloudy start with isolated
OL,14,Flight showers. Showers becoming more
OL,15,Ffrequent and turning heavy and
OL,16,Fthundery through the morning and
OL,17,Fafternoon, easing again later. Feeling
OL,18,Fcool in light northerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
